        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Kevin McCarthy has not demonstrated leadership capable of delivering meaningful change.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Congressman Dan Bishop has legitimate authority to judge whether a House leader is effective or not.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The current structure of House procedures reflects outdated practices that need reform.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the question as relevant and important enough to pose directly to Bishop.",
