    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "In a way, this seems like just political games. I mean, Kevin McCarthy doesn't quite have enough votes, but no other candidate has anywhere near the votes needed. Nobody else stands a chance. So if you can just extract some promises out of him of what you're looking for, isn't he destined to get the speaker's job?",
